      "itemId": "respectful-disagreement",
      "src": "/audio/stories/respectful-disagreement.mp3",
      "text": "Maya and Ben are choosing a location for a Friday book swap with thirty students. Ben points to the school courtyard and says, “We could hold it here because there's plenty of space.” “I see your point, but the forecast says it might rain,” Maya replies. “My main concern is keeping the books dry.” Ben suggests the library instead, although he is not sure whether it is available. “Let's compare the options before we decide,” Maya says. Ben agrees: “That sounds reasonable, as long as we check how much space we can use.” They write down their shared goal: a place with enough room and protection from the rain.",
      "textSha256": "9f8c693f345498e7f6ce24c02477b016c71a5c748201562cd60c2dfadab7295d"
